[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0109","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-20001","title":"Diffie-Hellman 密钥协商协议 D(HE)ater 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Diffie-Hellman 密钥交换协议存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者（客户端）可向服务器发送非公钥的任意数值，触发服务器端昂贵的 DHE 模幂运算，导致服务器 CPU 资源被大量消耗，造成拒绝服务。攻击者仅需极少的客户端计算资源和网络带宽即可发起攻击，且可要求服务器使用其支持的最大密钥长度以放大攻击效果。该漏洞影响所有支持 DHE 密码套件的 TLS 服务器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-20001"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2021-11-11T19:15:07.380","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:27.427","remediation":"建议在服务器端禁用 DHE 密码套件，仅启用 ECDHE 密钥交换；若必须支持 DHE，将 Diffie-Hellman 参数长度限制为 1024 位以下，并配置每连接 DH 计算超时（如 5 秒）；在 nginx 中设置 ssl_ciphers 'EECDH+AESGCM:EDH+AESGCM' 并移除 DHE 套件；Apache 中配置 SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters 并使用小参数文件；同时部署 TLS 1.3（仅支持 ECDHE），彻底消除 DHE 协商路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-506569.pdf","https://dheatattack.com","https://dheatattack.gitlab.io/","https://github.com/Balasys/dheater","https://github.com/mozilla/ssl-config-generator/issues/162","https://gitlab.com/dheatattack/dheater","https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10374117","https://support.f5.com/csp/article/K83120834","https://www.arubanetworks.com/assets/alert/ARUBA-PSA-2022-004.txt","https://www.openssl.org/blog/blog/2022/10/21/tls-groups-configuration/","https://www.reddit.com/r/netsec/comments/qdoosy/server_overload_by_enforcing_dhe_key_exchange/","https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Anton-Stiglic-2/publication/2401745_Security_Issues_in_the_Diffie-Hellman_Key_Agreement_Protocol","https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000020510","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-20001.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/4a0cf863db8d2032b534fdeb22ed679473499848/2002/CVE-2002-20001.json","https://github.com/OWASP/CheatSheetSeries/blob/92de0115bab1b671bf66cdfb7afca90f0974fa39/cheatsheets/Transport_Layer_Security_Cheat_Sheet.md","https://github.com/jtesta/ssh-audit/blob/111399e4319a7297c9edd075725048c5638dbceb/README.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/927a9d84fb186283fa3c636924460ca0aefac60e/2002/CVE-2002-20001.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2002-20001","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2021/gb_ssh_CVE-2002-20001_CVE-2022-40735.nasl","https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo/blob/f2163b4f7618847ae6f61df336623d37548fdbfc/unittests/scans/cycognito/one_vuln.json","https://github.com/c0r0n3r/dheater/blob/1b638ded0755f5d1b12f5f4ebfbde1ad8fa505cd/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2021/gb_ssl_tls_CVE-2002-20001.nasl","https://github.com/c0r0n3r/dheater","https://github.com/itmaniac/dheat_dos_attack_poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0104","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1580","title":"Cyrus IMAP 服务器预登录堆损坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cyrus IMAP 服务器 1.4 至 2.1.10 版本的 imapparse.c 文件中存在整数溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的包含超长长度值的 IMAP 协议数据包，触发整数溢出进而导致堆缓冲区溢出，最终可在 Cyrus IMAPD 进程上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Cyrus IMAPD 1.4、1.5.19、2.0.12、2.0.16、2.1.9 及 2.1.10 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者可在未登录前（Pre-Login）即触发该漏洞，利用门槛较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1580"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2004-06-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:35.490","remediation":"升级 Cyrus IMAP 服务器至 2.1.11 或更高版本（该漏洞在 2.1.11 中修复），或升级至 2.2.x 系列。对于无法升级的旧系统，可在 imapd.conf 中设置 `loginrawdisabled: 1` 禁用未认证阶段的 raw 命令处理，并在网络层面限制对 IMAP 端口（143/tcp、993/tcp）的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://asg.web.cmu.edu/cyrus/download/imapd/changes.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000557","http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000557","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-215","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/740169","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/301864","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6298","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10744","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22061","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1580.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1580","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1580.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1580.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5xcv-v8fh-pcrc/GHSA-5xcv-v8fh-pcrc.json","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports/blob/a70c5c3fd44b49eb692a4703fe91a62b37c58ce7/security/vuxml/vuln/2004.xml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/freebsd_cyrus_2017.nasl","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1580","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2004/FreeBSD-2004-0097.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/cyrus_imap_prelogin_overflow.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0103","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1569","title":"GNU gv 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"gv 3.5.8 及更早版本在处理 PDF 文件或 gzip 压缩文件的文件名时，未对 shell 元字符（如反引号、$()、| 等）进行有效过滤，存在命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 shell 元字符的特制文件名，诱使用户在 gv 中打开该文件，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1569"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-11-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:34.273","remediation":"升级 gv 至 3.5.8-27 及以上版本（Debian 对应版本 1:3.5.8-27），或直接升级至 3.7.4 及以上版本。该漏洞源于 gv 在处理 PDF 和 gzip 文件名时未过滤 shell 元字符，攻击者可构造恶意文件名触发任意命令执行。如无法升级，避免使用 gv 打开来源不明的 PDF/gzip 文件，或改用其他 PDF 阅读器（如 evince、okular）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0033.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103348446009076&w=2","http://www.epita.fr/~bevand_m/asa/asa-0000","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5840","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10231","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1569.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1569.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1569","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1569.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1569.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5c66-864x-76jc/GHSA-5c66-864x-76jc.json","https://github.com/0xCyberY/CVE-T4PDF/blob/91e0c8080e34fbea79154cd21d1239bd51201f30/README.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_147600_147700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2ac33f9d-24dc-4a35-8534-c62040065949.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/edb64b2fb998e69a1765a394aaca0eefbc537f56/2002/CVE-2002-1569.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0102","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1568","title":"OpenSSL SSLv2 CLIENT_MASTER_KEY 消息处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.6e 版本在处理 SSLv2 协议的 CLIENT_MASTER_KEY 消息时存在安全缺陷，s2_srvr.c 中的代码使用断言（assert）来检测缓冲区溢出攻击，而非采用更温和的错误处理机制。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 SSLv2 CLIENT_MASTER_KEY 消息，触发断言失败导致 OpenSSL 进程异常终止，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 OpenSSL 0.9.6e 及之前版本的服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1568"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-11-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:34.167","remediation":"升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.7 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 OpenSSL CVS 仓库提交补丁（chngview?cn=7659）修复 s2_srvr.c 中 SSLv2 CLIENT_MASTER_KEY 消息处理使用断言而非安全错误处理的问题。如无法立即升级，可在服务端配置中禁用 SSLv2 协议以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cvs.openssl.org/chngview?cn=7659","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=106511018214983","http://www.ebitech.sk/patrik/SA/SA-20031002.txt","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1568.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1568.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1568","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1568.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/cve-search/git-vuln-finder/blob/bbd45b41cbb96d8246e5919667d80b0d8f5a289c/README.md","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/vt-feed/nasl/2020/openssl/gb_openssl_CVE-2002-1568.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3626-95rf-mfw3/GHSA-3626-95rf-mfw3.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2002/1xxx/cve-2002-1568.yaml","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/OpenSSL%20SSLv2%20Client_Master_Key%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2002-1568).html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0101","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0101.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1566","title":"netris 远程内存破坏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Netris 0.5 及之前版本（0.52 以下）的 -w（等待）选项存在远程内存破坏漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，只需向目标服务器的 9284 端口发送特制的超长字符串，即可触发缓冲区溢出，导致 netris 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 netris 0.3/0.4/0.5 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1566"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-08-27T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:33.947","remediation":"升级 netris 至 0.52 或更高版本，该版本修复了通过向 9284 端口发送超长字符串导致服务崩溃的拒绝服务漏洞。如无法升级，建议在防火墙上限制对 9284 端口的公网访问，或避免使用 -w（wait）选项启动服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=103158692532256&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5680","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10081","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21784","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1566.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1566","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1566.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1566.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1566","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8f4h-52c3-crrw/GHSA-8f4h-52c3-crrw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1566.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d7aea8f1-1f42-4f5b-8f8e-792dfde8c214.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5680/info.html","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--d7aea8f1-1f42-4f5b-8f8e-792dfde8c214.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0100","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1565","title":"GNU wget url_filename函数缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Wget 1.8.1 的 url_filename 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 wget 发送特制的超长 URL 触发该漏洞，导致段错误引发拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 GNU Wget 1.8.1 及更早版本，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1565"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-06-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:33.837","remediation":"升级 wget 至 1.8.2 及以上版本（Debian  unstable 仓库已包含 1.8.2-8 修复版本）。如无法立即升级，可在使用 wget 时避免通过命令行或脚本传入超长 URL，并在网络边界或主机防火墙限制 wget 对外发起连接的目标范围，降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","col