tle":"stunnel stunnel SIGCHLD 信号处理程序竞争条件拒绝服务漏洞","description":"stunnel 4.0.3 及更早版本存在 SIGCHLD 信号处理程序竞态条件漏洞，当子进程退出时信号处理函数与主进程之间产生不一致状态，导致程序崩溃。攻击者需要本地系统访问权限且利用条件较为复杂，成功利用可造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 stunnel 4.0.3 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级低。厂商已在后续版本中修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1563"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-05-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:33.623","remediation":"升级 stunnel 至 4.04 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户可通过 `up2date` 命令自动更新，或下载 RHSA-2003:223 提供的 RPM 包执行 `rpm -Fvh *.rpm` 升级。升级后需重启以守护进程模式运行的 stunnel 实例，并重新建立所有活跃连接。如无法升级，可改用 xinetd 模式调用 stunnel 而非 daemon 模式，以规避信号处理竞争条件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000736","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104247606910598","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=106029168514511&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=stunnel-users&m=103600188215117&w=2","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-3535.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-221.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-223.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6592","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1563.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1563.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1563","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1563.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6234-fx93-pwcr/GHSA-6234-fx93-pwcr.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-223.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_200_300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1563.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x7000/6592/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0098","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1479","title":"Raxnet Cacti 配置文件敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cacti 0.6.8 之前版本存在敏感信息泄露漏洞，其 config.php 文件以明文存储 MySQL 数据库用户名和密码，且该文件权限设置为全局可读（world-readable）。本地攻击者可通过读取该配置文件获取数据库凭据，进而以 Cacti 用户身份修改数据库内容，可能导致权限提升或数据篡改。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者需拥有目标系统的本地访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1479"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24.310","remediation":"升级 Cacti 至 0.6.8 或更高版本，该版本已修复 config.php 中明文存储 MySQL 密码的问题。升级后执行 chmod 640 config.php 限制配置文件权限仅允许 Web 用户和 root 读取，并修改 MySQL 账户密码。如无法升级，立即执行 chmod 640 config.php 并移除文件中的数据库密码，改用环境变量或受限配置文件存储凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0028.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10049.php","http://www.knights-of-the-routing-table.org/advisories/krt_001_20020903_cacti.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5628","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1479.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1479","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1479.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/Patrowl