完全控制目标服务器，窃取敏感数据或横向移动。该漏洞影响 Cacti 0.6.8 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已在 0.6.8 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1477"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:24.077","remediation":"升级 Cacti 至 0.6.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 graphs.php 中 title 参数未正确过滤 shell 元字符的问题。如无法升级，限制仅信任的管理员账号可访问编辑功能，并在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面过滤 title 参数中的 `;`、`|`、`&`、`$` 等 shell 特殊字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0028.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-164","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10048.php","http://www.knights-of-the-routing-table.org/advisories/krt_001_20020903_cacti.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5627","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1477.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1477","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1477.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1477.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/high/Raxnet%20Cacti%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A1%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2002-1477).html","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-164.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-89r6-x49c-h6w2/GHSA-89r6-x49c-h6w2.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-164.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146900_147000.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2002.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0095","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1471","title":"Ximian Evolution SSL证书验证绕过漏洞","description":"Ximian Evolution 1.0.x 及更早版本的 camel 组件存在 SSL 证书验证绕过漏洞。当客户端首次建立 SSL 连接并验证证书后，后续在同一会话中建立新的 SSL 连接时，camel 组件未能重新验证服务器证书的有效性。远程攻击者可通过中间人攻击方式，在客户端与服务器之间插入恶意代理，拦截或篡改加密通信内容，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者只需处于同一网络路径即可实施攻击，无需身份认证，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1471"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-04-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:23.413","remediation":"升级 Ximian Evolution 至 1.1.0 或更高版本，该版本在每次建立新 SSL 连接时均强制验证证书链。若无法升级，可在 Evolution 配置中禁用 SSL/TLS 自动连接功能，或使用 stunnel 等工具在客户端与服务器之间建立独立 TLS 隧道，由外部工具接管证书验证逻辑。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0045.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10292.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5875","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1471.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1471","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1471.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1471.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p84-cvh4-gvvh/GHSA-5p84-cvh4-gvvh.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/c